        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūja kūlī Sang'weli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha nsabi, wa mu lūganda lo Benjamini, lina lyakwe witanagwa Kishi, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Abieli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zeloli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bekolaati, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Afia, ūmò wa banhū ba lūganda lo ng'wa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na ng'witūnja witanagwa Saulo, nsūmba wawiza ūyo walī atī na wa kūlenganījiwa nang'hwe ū mu Baisilaeli; hama ngololoku nīhu kūbakīla pye a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Kishi ū ise o ng'wa Saulo akajimīīja nzobe jakwe, hūna ūng'wīla ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Saulo, “Bebe solaga nsūmba ūmò wa batūmami ūje nang'hwe mukajikoobe ī nzobe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ūbūūka, ūja akūbīta bītaga kū magūlya ga mu sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu, na mu sī ya Shalisha; alīyo batajipandīkile. Bīnga ū kwenūko būja mu sī ya Shalimu, nū kwene jalī jitīko. Hama ūgalūka kwiza mu sī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, nū ng'wene būjigayiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baashika mu sī ya Sufu, ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū ntūmami ūyo walī hamò nang'hwe, “Tūshokage ī gete, nguno nose ū baba akooya ū kūjiiganika ī nzobe, andye kūkoya ū mu maganiko kūlwa nguno yise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntūmami ūng'wīla, “Bebe ū mu nzengo gwenūyū akabizaga alīmo munhū o ng'wa Mulungu akūjiwe na banhū, nguno būlī mhayo ūyo ūgūhaya gūkashikīīlaga. Tūjage ho, hamo adūgije kūtoolekeja ī nzīla īyo shiigelile twīsole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe, “Ūlū tūlaaje ū kūlī munhū ng'wenūyo, tūkūjūng'winha kī, īkī twamalaga ī shilīwa ū mu mfuko gwise? Tūtī na sha kūng'winha ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu; ī gīsī tūlī na kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami ūnshokeja ū Saulo ūng'wīla, “Alilolaga aha, nalī na feza ngehu ja būdito wa kwegeela ha gulamu idatū. Nakūng'winha ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu atūwīle ī nzīla īyo shiigelile twīsole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ī kale ū mu Baisilaeli ūlū munhū ūja kūbūūja kūlī Mulungu, wahayaga, “Tūjage kūlī moni,” nguno ū munhū ūyo akwitanagwa ng'hangi ī haha, ī kale witanagwa moni.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe, “Watūngīlīja ī gete tūjage ng'hana wa.” Hūna būgoloola bajile ū kū nzengo ūyo walī ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī ū mu lūgendo bajile, būsanja na bashīke balītulumenha kūja kūdaha minzī; būbabūūja, “Bing'we bamayū, ū moni alīho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbashokeja būhaya, “Alīho alīko dūhū ūko mujile kwenūko; ihuutagi mukūnsanga ko; nīyo washika lelo īyī dūhū ū mu nzengo gwise. Nguno a banhū balīfunya shitambò ū kwigūlya ū kwipandī lya kūlamīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulashike ū mu nzengo mukūmona aho ataalī kūja ū kwipandī lya kwigūlya kūjūūlya shilīwa. A banhū batūdūla ū kwandya ū kūlya aho ataalī ū kūshika, nguno hū wei ū wa kūshilombela ī shitambò. Hanuma abo balaalīkilwe hū bakūlya; linhagi muje ko, a makanza aya hū gene a ga kūnsanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlinha bajile ū kū nzengo, aho balingīla mo dūhū ī gīkī, ū Sang'weli nang'hwe ūūyū; aliiza kūdimana nabo alīlinha ajile ū kwipandī lya kwigūlya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūlūngalūnga na Sang'weli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū lūshikū lwigolo yaho, ū SEEBA walī wang'olekeja ū Sang'weli ū mhayo gwenūyo; ūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī ntondo makanza gītī genaya nakūkūtūmīla munhū wa kūfuma mu sī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini; ū ng'wenūyo ng'witīīlage maguta abize ntongeeji wa banhū bane a Baisilaeli. Akūbapīja a banhū bane kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa Bafilisiti; nguno naababonile a banhū bane, nū kūlīla kwabo kwanipandīkile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Sang'weli aho wamona ū Saulo, ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Ū ng'wenūyū h'ū munhū ūyo nakakūwīla mhola jakwe; h'ūyo akūbiza ntongeeji wa banhū baane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Saulo ūng'wegeela ū Sang'weli aho baashika ha mita; ūng'wīla, “Baba nalīlomba ūnoolekeje ūko īlī ī numba ya moni!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūnshokeja, “Ū nene hū nalī ng'wene ū moni, tongelaga tūje ū kwipandī lya kwigūlya, nguno ī lelo ūkūlya hamò naane, ntondo dilū nakūkūwīla pyī īyo īlī mu ng'holò yako, hūna nakūlage ūje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya nzobe ījo jashishaga shikū idatū jijimīīlile, ī yene ītizūkūkoya nguno jilongile. Ī gīsī ng'hana, īyo banhū bingī bayikūmbilwe ū mu Isilaeli ībīkilwe kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa nani, ūlū ītī kūlwa nguno yako na numba ya ng'wa so?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūshosha, “Ū nene natī munhū wa lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini ūlo lūlī lūdo ū mu ng'anda jose ja Baisilaeli? Ū lūdūgū ūlo nafumile nalo lūtī lūdo lwa bado ū mu ndūgū ja lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini; mhayo kī gwakwenheleja nose ūniwīle mihayo īlī gīko?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūnshisha ū Saulo nū ntūmami wakwe ū mu numba īyo baalīīlaga shilīwa, ūbatūūla kwigasha h'ipandī lya bakūjiwa kūtinda bose abo baalīmo, banhū gītī makūmi adatū gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla ū nzugi, “Yenhage aha ī nyama īyo nakakūwīla kwībīka ha mhūjo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzugi ūgwenha ū gūlūmbū, nī shisho shalī hamò nago, ūntengela ū Saulo. Ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla, “Ī yenīyī hū'īyo walī wabīkīlilwe bebe. Lyaga nguno yalī ītūūlilwe kūlwa nguno yako kūlw'ikanza lyenīlī, kūfuma aho nakahayīla gīkī, ‘Nakūbiza na bageni.’” Ū Saulo ūlya shilīwa hamò na Sang'weli ū lūshikū lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bika ū kūfuma ū kwipandī lya kwigūlya baashika ū mu nzengo, ū Sang'weli ūhooya nū Saulo kwigūlya ya numba yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntondo yaho ī dilū aho baamisha, ū Sang'weli ūng'witana ū Saulo ū kwigūlya ya numba ūko walī; ūng'wīla, “Bebe igolanyage koi wangū nakūshindīkīle.” Ū Saulo aho wamalamaja, wika būfuma bajile nū Sang'weli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
